      "widgets_values": [
        "Pixel art game sprite animation, same chibi punk guitarist facing RIGHT in side view. Black and magenta spiky hair, pale face, black and pink jacket, black pants, pink boots with white soles, holding the same white electric guitar with both hands. One explosive side-view dash toward the right, performed in place for a game sprite. Bend knees into a low crouch, lean the torso strongly forward to the right, push the trailing left leg straight behind, forward right knee tucked under chest. Hold a very low streamlined forward lunging pose for most of the animation, hair swept backward, guitar tucked close across the chest. Then brake by bending the front knee and recover to standing. Clear distinct anticipation, low forward dash, and recovery poses. Keep the face, hairstyle, clothing, guitar and body proportions unchanged. Fixed camera and orientation, full body visible with generous margins, no zoom. Single character alone on a flat solid gray background, crisp pixel art. Return to the original standing pose at the end. "
      ],
